% diag_rule_duplicate: one rule name in two blocks of a stage (dup-rule-names s-dfb61f45, spec/18 §4).
catalog diag_rule_duplicate 1.
provenance text "a duplicate rule" "2026-11-02".
layers (dyn).
stages (act).
namespace d produce (dyn).
pred p : d.
pred q : d.
stage act {
  %% It takes p.
  aa [dyn] : p -o q.
}
stage act {
  %% It takes q, under the same name.
  aa [dyn] : q -o p.
}
